<li>Klemens dari Alexandria (5592 SM),</li>
<li>Theophilus of Antioch (5529 SM),</li>
<li>Julius Africanus (5501 SM),</li>
<li>Hippolytus of Rome (5500 SM),</li>
<li>Gregory of Tours (5500 SM),</li>
<li>Panodorus of Alexandria (5493 SM),</li>
<li>Maximus the Confessor (5493 SM),</li>
<li>George Syncellus (5492 SM)</li>
<li>Sulpicius Severus (5469 SM),</li>
<li>Isidore of Seville (5336 SM),</li>
<li>Eusebius (5228 SM), dan</li>
<li>Jerome (5199 SM). Kalender Bizantin secara tradisional memberi tarikh penciptaan dunia pada tanggal 1 September 5509 SM.</li>
</ul>
